{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07104","headline":"却赴南邑留别苏台知己 · 刘长卿","name":"却赴南邑留别苏台知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"又过梅岭上，岁岁此枝寒。\n落日孤舟去，青山万里看。\n猨声湘水静，草色洞庭宽。\n已料生涯事，唯应把钓竿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}